# Architecture

Read and follow `PROJECT_STRUCTURE.md` at the repo root.

- Flat root layout (no `src/`). Alias `@/*` -> `./*`.
- Data flow: `components` -> `hooks/queries` -> `services` -> `lib/axios`. Never reverse.
- Pages in `app/[lang]/...` stay thin; logic lives outside `app/`.
- Primary locale is Persian (`fa`, RTL). English (`en`, LTR) is secondary. Also supported: Arabic (`ar`, RTL), Russian (`ru`, LTR), Chinese Simplified (`zh`, LTR), Japanese (`ja`, LTR), German (`de`, LTR).
- Next.js 16 uses `proxy.ts` (not `middleware.ts`) for locale/auth redirects.
